"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how software interacts with hardware."}]},{"heading":"Microcontroller Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start with platforms such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"STM32"},{"text":"ESP32"},{"text":"Arduino for initial learning"},{"text":"ARM Cortex-M"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GPIO"},{"text":"Timers"},{"text":"Interrupts"},{"text":"PWM"},{"text":"ADC"},{"text":"UART"},{"text":"SPI"},{"text":"I2C"},{"text":"DMA"},{"text":"Watchdog timers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Embedded Systems + Automotive Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Embedded Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bare-metal programming"},{"text":"Interrupts"},{"text":"Memory-mapped I/O"},{"text":"Drivers"},{"text":"Hardware abstraction"},{"text":"Real-time concepts"},{"text":"Debugging"},{"text":"Firmware architecture"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build projects such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensor data logger"},{"text":"Motor controller"},{"text":"Temperature controller"},{"text":"CAN communication node"},{"text":"Automotive dashboard prototype"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Automotive Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"This is a critical skill area."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"CAN"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAN frames"},{"text":"Arbitration"},{"text":"CAN IDs"},{"text":"Bit rates"},{"text":"Error handling"},{"text":"CAN bus architecture"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other protocols"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LIN"},{"text":"FlexRay"},{"text":"Automotive Ethernet"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UDS"},{"text":"Diagnostics"},{"text":"OBD-II concepts"},{"text":"DoIP"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical vehicle communication:"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU 1 ───┐"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU 2 ───┤"},{"type":"p","te