AC"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Chassis"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ABS"},{"text":"ESC"},{"text":"Steering"},{"text":"Suspension"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Safety"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airbags"},{"text":"Occupant detection"},{"text":"Safety controllers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Infotainment"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Displays"},{"text":"Connectivity"},{"text":"Audio"},{"text":"Navigation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Electric Vehicle Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"For modern automotive careers, learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Battery packs"},{"text":"Battery cells"},{"text":"BMS"},{"text":"State of Charge"},{"text":"State of Health"},{"text":"Thermal management"},{"text":"Inverters"},{"text":"Electric motors"},{"text":"DC/DC converters"},{"text":"On-board chargers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Architecture:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Battery","Battery Management System","Inverter","Electric Motor","Transmission","Wheels"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Sensors ──→ Vehicle Control Unit","Torque / Energy Control"]},{"type":"h","text":"ADAS Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Because the specialization includes autonomous vehicles, learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Radar"},{"text":"LiDAR"},{"text":"Cameras"},{"text":"Ultrasonic sensors"},{"text":"Sensor fusion"},{"text":"Object detection"},{"text":"Lane detection"},{"text":"Tracking"},{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Path planning"},{"text":"Control"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Basic autonomous stack:"},{"type":"p","text":"Sensors"},{"type":"flow","items":["(Camera / Radar / LiDAR)","Sensor Processing","Sensor Fusion","Perception","Localization","Prediction","Planning","Control","Vehicle Actuators"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Advanced Automotive Embedded Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on becoming production-oriented, not just project-oriented."},{"type":"h","text":"Functional Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ISO 26262 concepts"},{"text":"Hazard analysis"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"ASIL"},{"text":"Safety goals"},{"text":"Safety mechanisms"},{"text":"Fault detection"},{"text":"Redundancy"},{"text":"Diagnostic coverage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand why safety-critical automotive software requires disciplined development and verification."},{"type":"h","text":"Automotive Cybersecurity"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Secure boot"},{"text":"Encryption"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Key management"},{"text":"Secure diagnostics"},{"text":"ECU security"},{"text":"Intrusion detection"},{"text":"Secure OTA updates"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Study concepts associated with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automotive cybersecurity engineering"},{"text":"Secure vehicle communication"},{"text":"Vehicle threat modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software-Defined Vehicles"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Centralised vehicle computing"},{"text":"Zonal architecture"},{"text":"Vehicle operating systems"},{"text":"OTA updates"},{"text":"Service-oriented architecture"},{"text":"Automotive Ethernet"},{"text":"Cloud-connected vehicles"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional architecture:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Many ECUs","Many Domain Controllers","Vehicle Network"]},{"type":"p","text":"Emerging architecture:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sensors / Actuators","Zonal Controllers","High-Performance Compute","Vehicle Software Platform","Cloud / OTA Services"]},{"type":"h","text":"Development & Testing Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should gain exposure to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Embedded Development"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"STM32CubeIDE"},{"text":"Keil"},{"text":"GCC"},{"text":"GDB"},{"text":"JTAG/SWD"},{"text":"Logic analysers"},{"text":"Oscilloscopes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Automotive"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CANoe"},{"text":"CANalyzer"},{"text":"Vector ecosystem"},{"text":"Automotive diagnostic tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"GitHub/GitLab"},{"text":"CMake"},{"text":"CI/CD"},{"text":"Static analysis tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Simulation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MATLAB/Simulink"},{"text":"Stateflow"},{"text":"CARLA"},{"text":"ROS 2"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"},{"type":"h","text":"1. CAN-Based Vehicle Monitoring System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a miniature vehicle network containing multiple ECUs."},{"type":"p","text":"ECU — Engine Data"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU — Battery Data"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU — Temperature"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"flow","items":["ECU — Speed","CAN Bus","Gateway ECU","Dashboard"]},{"type":"p","text":"Implement:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAN communication"},{"text":"Sensor acquisition"},{"text":"Error detection"},{"text":"Dashboard"},{"text":"Data logging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Automotive BMS Prototype"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simplified battery-management system."},{"type":"p","text":"Monitor:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Voltage"},{"text":"Current"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"State of Charge"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Over-voltage protection"},{"text":"Under-voltage detection"},{"text":"Thermal alerts"},{"text":"Fault logging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. ADAS Lane-Detection System"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Camera"},{"text":"OpenCV"},{"text":"Python/C++"},{"text":"Embedded processing where feasible"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Pipeline:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Camera","Image Processing","Lane Detection","Lane Position","Warning / Control"]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Embedded Blind-Spot Detection"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Radar or ultrasonic sensing"},{"text":"Microcontroller"},{"text":"CAN"},{"text":"Warning system"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Detect vehicles i