:"High-performance automotive computing"},{"text":"Solid-state batteries"},{"text":"Advanced battery management"},{"text":"Vehicle operating systems"},{"text":"Robotics and autonomous mobility"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Embedded Systems","Software-Defined Vehicles","AI","Automotive Safety"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"AUTOMOTIVE"},{"type":"p","text":"EMBEDDED ENGINEER"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌───────────┼───────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"EMBEDDED AUTOMOTIVE SOFTWARE"},{"type":"p","text":"SYSTEMS NETWORKS ENGINEERING"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"p","text":"C / C++ CAN Git"},{"type":"p","text":"MCU LIN Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"RTOS Ethernet CI/CD"},{"type":"p","text":"Drivers UDS Debugging"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"flow","items":["└───────────┼──────────────┘","AUTOSAR / ECU"]},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌───────────┼───────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"EV ADAS SAFETY"},{"type":"p","text":"BMS Perception ISO 26262"},{"type":"p","text":"Controls Sensor Fusion Security"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"flow","items":["└───────────┼───────────┘","SOFTWARE-DEFINED VEHICLE"]},{"type":"flow","items":["│","AUTONOMOUS MOBILITY"]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be capable of taking an embedded automotive requirement through:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Automotive Requirement","System Architecture","ECU Design","Embedded C/C++","Driver Development","RTOS","CAN / Automotive Ethernet","AUTOSAR / Middleware","Unit Testing","Integration Testing","Diagnostics","Safety / Security Checks","Hardware-in-the-Loop","Vehicle-Level Validation"]},{"type":"p","text":"The graduate should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong C"},{"text":"Good C++"},{"text":"Embedded C"},{"te